<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>Kids Home Safe – Protect Your Kids Online</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <meta name="description" content="Step-by-step guides, tools, and services to help parents protect their kids online – web filters, phone monitoring, app safety, and home Wi-Fi hardening." />
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-950 text-slate-100">
  <header class="border-b border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/80 backdrop-blur sticky top-0 z-30">
    <nav class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-3 flex items-center justify-between">
      <a href="index.html" class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <img src="assets/logo.png" alt="Kids Home Safe Logo" class="h-10 w-10 object-contain" />
        <span class="font-semibold text-lg">Kids Home Safe</span>
      </a>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-8 text-sm font-medium">
        <a href="filters.html" class="hover:text-indigo-300">Web Filters</a>
        <a href="safe.html" class="hover:text-indigo-300">Safe Browsing</a>
        <a href="device-monitoring.html" class="hover:text-indigo-300">Phones &amp; Apps</a>
        <a href="services.html" class="hover:text-indigo-300">Home Setup</a>
      </div>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 pt-16 pb-16 text-center">
      
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-indigo-400 mb-4 font-bold">Family Cyber Safety</p>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-semibold leading-tight mb-6">
          Protect your kids online<br />
          <span class="text-indigo-400">without being a tech expert.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-sm md:text-lg text-slate-300 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          Simple, step-by-step guides that help you block harmful content, monitor devices,
          and secure your home Wi-Fi so your kids can explore the internet more safely.
        </p>
        
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 mb-8">
          <a
            href="assets/KHS-checklist.pdf"
            download="Kids-Home-Safe-Internet-Safety-Checklist.pdf"
            class="px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-indigo-500 hover:bg-indigo-400 text-sm font-medium transition"
          >
            Start with the free safety checklist
          </a>
          <a href="filters.html" class="px-6 py-3 rounded-full border border-slate-700 hover:border-indigo-400 text-sm transition">
            See recommended filters
          </a>
        </div>
        
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3 text-xs text-slate-400 mb-12">
          <span class="inline-flex w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
          <span>Created by parents + IT security professionals.</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto mb-16 relative">
        <div class="absolute -inset-1 bg-indigo-500/20 blur-2xl rounded-[2rem] -z-10"></div>
        <img 
          src="assets/kidshomesafe.png" 
          alt="Kids Home Safe" 
          class="w-full rounded-[2rem] shadow-2xl border border-slate-800"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-left">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-3">What you’ll learn here</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-300">
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="mt-1 w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-xs flex-shrink-0">1</span>
            <span>How to set up <strong>free and paid web filters</strong> that block adult content, malware, and risky sites.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="mt-1 w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-xs flex-shrink-0">2</span>
            <span>How to use tools like <strong>Apple Screen Time, Google Family Link, and Bark</strong> to monitor apps and screen time.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="mt-1 w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-xs flex-shrink-0">3</span>
            <span>How to lock down your <strong>home Wi-Fi</strong> so kids can’t simply bypass your protections.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </section>

    <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 pb-16 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <a href="filters.html" class="group bg-slate-900/70 border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl p-5 hover:border-indigo-400 transition">
        <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2 text-sm">1. Web filters</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 mb-3">
          Compare free and paid filters like CleanBrowsing, OpenDNS, Bark, and Net Nanny with clear setup guides.
        </p>
        <span class="text-xs text-indigo-300 group-hover:underline">See filters →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="device-monitoring.html" class="group bg-slate-900/70 border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl p-5 hover:border-indigo-400 transition">
        <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2 text-sm">2. Phones &amp; apps</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 mb-3">
          Learn how to track location, manage screen time, and monitor risky apps on iPhone, Android, and tablets.
        </p>
        <span class="text-xs text-indigo-300 group-hover:underline">Protect devices →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="services.html" class="group bg-slate-900/70 border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl p-5 hover:border-indigo-400 transition">
        <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2 text-sm">3. Done-for-you setup</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 mb-3">
          In the Kansas City / Lee’s Summit area? Get a professional to set everything up in your home for you.
        </p>
        <span class="text-xs text-indigo-300 group-hover:underline">See home setup options →</span>
      </a>
    </section>

    <section id="cta" class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 pb-20">
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-600 to-purple-500 rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold mb-2">Download the free Family Internet Safety Checklist</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-indigo-100 max-w-xl">
            A one-page checklist that walks you through the 10 most important steps to protect your kids at home:
            web filters, device settings, Wi-Fi security, and family rules.
          </p>
        </div>
        <a
          href="assets/KHS-checklist.pdf"
          download="Kids-Home-Safe-Internet-Safety-Checklist.pdf"
          class="px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-slate-950 text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-slate-900"
        >
          Get the free checklist (PDF)
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="border-t border-slate-800 py-6 text-xs text-slate-500">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between gap-3">
      <p>© <span id="year"></span> Kids Home Safe. All rights reserved.</p>
      <div class="flex gap-4">
        <a href="services.html#contact" class="hover:text-indigo-300">Contact</a>
        <a href="#" class="hover:text-indigo-300">Privacy</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <script>
      document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();
    </script>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>